# MLD (igmpd -6): an IPv6 row whose delete fails after its group is done is
# tried again with the next resync, as an IPv4 one is (expiry-del-fail).
# The done at 10 ends the membership at 12.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=0
end
0 tick
1 mld1join 1 0 fe80::2 ff3e::8000:1
10 mld1done 1 0 fe80::2 ff3e::8000:1
11 hwfail 2
12 tick
16 tick
17 tick
18 tick
